<title>JAPAN: Japan Carlit - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Carlit - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.93		vs	    6.23</p>
<p> Operating	  137    million    vs	  259    million</p>
<p> Current	     57    million    vs	  178    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 70    million    vs	 prft 18 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.52 yen	  vs     prft 0.95 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Carlit Co Ltd is a maker of industrial chemicals, abrasives and explosives.</p>
